This project is inspired by and adapts architectural patterns from the
Microsoft/Azure Samples Multi-Agent Banking Assistant:
https://github.com/Azure-Samples/agent-openai-python-banking-assistant

The upstream project is Copyright (c) 2024 Azure Samples and licensed under
the MIT License. This repository retains the upstream license notice and
clearly identifies its independent portfolio-focused modifications.

Modifications include a compact FastAPI service, deterministic offline agents,
optional Microsoft Agent Framework integration, FastMCP tools, human approval
controls, audit events, risk policy checks, tests, CI, and a React interface.

